category: Libs
build-depends: cygport CUnit libxml2-devel udis86-devel
sdesc: "Library to access information about PE binary (utilities)"
ldesc: "The libpenetra was created with the goal of studying the windows binary format
known as Portable Executable (PE). With libpenetra you can access all info
about PE binaries."
